<title>UK: Abbey says dealing room back on-line.</title>
<headline>Abbey says dealing room back on-line.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abbey National Plc said on Wednesday that the trading room at its Abbey National Treasury Services (ANTS) unit was now back on-line after a small fire in a computer room disrupted trading earlier in the day.</p>
<p>The Abbey said dealers had returned to their desks and it expected to fulfil its obligations without further disruption. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864.</p>
</text>
